---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Travel & Stay"
  description="Getting to Taipei and staying near the Mandarin Oriental for Kevin and Joyce's wedding."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Taipei</p>
      <h1>Travel &amp; stay</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Helpful notes for reaching Taipei and lodging near the Mandarin Oriental.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container grid-2">
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Getting to Taipei</h2>
        <p>
          Most international guests arrive at Taiwan Taoyuan International Airport
          (TPE). From there, the Airport MRT, taxis, and private transfers make it
          straightforward to reach central Taipei.
        </p>
        <p>
          Songshan Airport (TSA) is closer to the venue for some regional flights.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Staying near the venue</h2>
        <p>
          The wedding is at the <strong>Mandarin Oriental, Taipei</strong> in
          Songshan District, along Dunhua North Road. Guests who prefer to stay
          on-site can inquire directly with the hotel about availability.
        </p>
        <p>
          The Dunhua / Nanjing area also has many nearby hotels within a short
          taxi or MRT ride of the venue.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Getting around</h2>
        <p>
          Taipei's MRT is clean, frequent, and easy to navigate in English.
          Taxis and ride-hailing apps are widely available. The Mandarin Oriental
          sits near major roads and MRT connections in eastern Taipei.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Neighborhood notes</h2>
        <p>
          Songshan and nearby Zhongshan / Dazhi offer restaurants, cafés, and
          shopping within easy reach of the hotel. We'll add favorite spots and
          any group-rate hotel notes here as they become available.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
